<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n33415" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔλᾰσις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>, ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>driving away, banishing</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν ἐναγῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					1.139
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				1.140
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔ. βοσκημάτων</span>
			<i>driving</i> of them <i>away</i> as booty, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Rom.</u>
				7
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στρατοῦ</span>) <i>march, expedition</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπὶ Σκύθας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					4.1
				</span></i>
			, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔλασιν ποιέεσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					7.37
				</span></i>
			; also, <i>procession</i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				8.3.34
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ ἅλαδε ἔ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				22.847.20
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἵιππου</span>) <i>riding</i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Eq.</u>
				9.6
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Eq.Mag.</u>
				8.2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Aristaenet.
				1.8
			</span></i>; <i>charge of horse</i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				6.12
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Sull.</u>
				19
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b>
			<i>driving</i> a chariot, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>DDeor.</u>
				25.2
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b> (
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐλαύνω</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					11
				</span></i>
			) <i>striking</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Apollon.
				<u>Lex.</u>
			</span></i>
			
				s.v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐλαύνωσι</span>
			.</div>
